Division by zero:
== Query ==
SELECT sint8
     , sum(1 / (sint8 - sint8)) as div_zero
FROM tbl
GROUP BY sint8;

Number of output lines, including header: 2

== Diff ==
==========



Integer division by zero:
== Query ==
SELECT sint8
     , sum(1 DIV (sint8 - sint8)) as intdiv_zero
FROM tbl
GROUP BY sint8;

